    "description": {
      "value": "<p>以一个动作，你可以将这张卡片投向距你60尺内表面上的一个未被占据的空间，同时说出命令语，然后卡片会魔法性地变成一张<strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.summons.Actor.IX8v8e0yfc245kim]{牌组守卫deck defender}</strong>（数据参见第九章），守卫会持续存在1分钟或者直到你再次用一个动作说出命令语。牌组守卫遵循你的口头命令。如果你没有发布命令，它会采取闪避动作并躲避危险。牌组守卫的生命值降至0时，它会提前变回一张卡。这一特性一经使用，直到次日黎明之前无法再次使用。</p><p>As an action, you can throw this card to an unoccupied space on the ground within 60 feet of yourself while speaking a command word, whereupon the card magically transforms into a @creature[deck defender|BMT] (see <span class=\"bold\">chapter 9</span> for its stat block) for up to 1 minute or until you use an action to speak the command word again, whereupon it transforms back into a card. The deck defender obeys your spoken commands. If you issue no commands, it takes the @action[Dodge] action and moves to avoid danger. The deck defender reverts to a card early if it drops to 0 hit points. Once this property is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p>",
